        },
        {
          "text": "«Hee burkwa óh dír harér heé hatlá' wa ale, inooín tsaraawo aqo kin tsuu/, hhawaata nee /ameenirihe. Adoorí an adoodá' tlakweema kir hingeesa' baraá tla/angwhunge.",
