          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "inooín tsaraawo duuxaak baraá gixsaro nee ki tlaqutá' ar tlaa/e ay dír i qatliya'. Dasiirí in hariín kawa tlaa/ér tlaquuti as inós iwa tseiká, as kawa alee/isi, inós iqo baraá gixsárí dirí'. Hhawaata aqo kun gaas asma dasír inslaawmoowós i lehhiiti ga alsi'imúr áy. Adoorí an adoodá' tlakweema kir hingeesa' baraá tla/angwhunge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.24"
            ]
          }
        }
